{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>市場關注中東局勢發展，原油期貨價格漲跌互見，整體變幅不大。</p><p></p><p>紐約期油收市報97.15美元一桶，跌67美仙，跌幅近百分之0.7。倫敦期油收市報108.82美元一桶，升3美仙，升幅百分之0.03。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T23:21:49.324635+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":96,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T22:15:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T01:38:02.757007+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T23:17:42.183639+00:00","content_hash":"02145a6b9538a88f435696d60eba92e5a844d54bfdf653e2e5806abd0de517b9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}